OpenStory MyAnimeList catalog plugin notice

This package contains OpenStory plugin code only. It does not bundle MyAnimeList catalog
records, third-party credentials, API keys, cookies, or copied page content.

Runtime metadata is requested directly from the MyAnimeList API using a client identifier
provided by the host application. The plugin preserves MyAnimeList manga IDs as source
identifiers and does not perform account mutations.

The project-wide OpenStory license selected for release will govern this plugin source.
Upstream service and metadata rights remain with their respective owners.
